This static website contains generated HTML/JavaScript, SVG figures, sampled
CSV/JSON data and analysis. It does not distribute robot STL meshes, rendered
URDF snapshots, numerical seed banks or the scanner's linked libraries.

The original V1 demo is retained at the root. The matched V1/V2 comparison is
under comparison/. These results are model-based samples, not hardware tests.
